WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.040
Run an SEO audit, show its value, and plan 90 days.

2
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.800
This is the video for module four of the SEO course.

3
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:19.550
An SEO audit is a structured check of how well a site and its Business Profile can be found, understood and chosen. It ends with a list of fixes in order.

4
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:26.470
First, indexing: is the site verified, the sitemap submitted, and are important pages in Google?

5
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:33.990
Second, technical health: secure HTTPS, mobile layout, page speed, broken links.

6
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:43.050
Third, on-page and content: unique titles, one H1, alt text, and helpful content for each keyword group.

7
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:51.550
Fourth, local presence: a verified profile, the right category, and the same name, address and phone everywhere.

8
00:00:52.800 --> 00:01:00.780
Fifth, measurement and links. Always work in this order, because a page Google cannot index gains nothing from a better title.

9
00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:10.740
Record every issue in one row of a sheet, with evidence, impact, effort and the fix. An issue without evidence is only an opinion.

10
00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:16.310
For example, Blessing audits a furniture workshop's website in Aba for her capstone.

11
00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:27.080
Only 9 of 14 pages are indexed. The 5 missing pages are only reachable through a broken menu link. Impact high, effort easy.

12
00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:34.640
On mobile, the gallery page takes 5.9 seconds, because of 40 uncompressed photos.

13
00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.750
7 pages share the title Aba Furniture.

14
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.760
The Business Profile is unverified, uses the category Store, and its phone number differs from the website's.

15
00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:56.720
She logs 19 issues and sorts by impact, then effort. Six quick wins rise to the top, and the owner can start the same day.

16
00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:09.060
Get the owner's agreement in writing first. A WhatsApp message is fine. Ask to be added as a Restricted user in Search Console and as a manager on the Business Profile.

17
00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:14.700
Then test like a customer: search, open the site, and try to send a WhatsApp message.

18
00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:26.150
Never ask for passwords. Look at competitors to explain your advice, never to copy them. Never promise rankings. And show the evidence without blaming anyone.

19
00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:35.570
Owners want to know if SEO is worth it. Google says it usually takes four months to a year to show benefit, so share that early.

20
00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:42.620
For example, Blessing reports to the furniture workshop after three months, using only figures the owner gives her.

21
00:02:43.870 --> 00:03:00.850
Analytics shows 64 WhatsApp taps from Google search last month. The owner says about 1 in 8 chats becomes a sale. That is 8 sales. His average order is about 180,000 naira, so about 1,440,000 naira.

22
00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:07.970
Before the work there were 15 taps, about 2 sales, so about 360,000 naira.

23
00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:17.620
The difference is about 1,080,000 naira in the month, clearly marked as an estimate. He agrees to continue for another quarter.

24
00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:26.490
For example, Funke has about 4 hours a week. In days 1 to 14 she fixes her 5 quick wins from the audit.

25
00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:37.680
In days 15 to 45 she builds a topic cluster: one main page, Wedding Cakes in Ibadan, plus three supporting articles that all link to it.

26
00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:45.630
In days 46 to 75 she builds a second cluster, and posts on her Business Profile every week.

27
00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:54.430
In days 76 to 90 she compares with her baseline and writes her report. Then she plans the next 90 days.

28
00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:05.560
To earn your certificate, complete the capstone and score at least 70 percent in the final quiz. Check your capstone against these six items before you submit.

29
00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:19.910
To remember. Audit in order, with evidence. Start with quick wins. Show value in calls, chats and naira, using the owner's figures. Promise the work, never a ranking. And plan in 90-day cycles.

30
00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:28.620
Now audit a real site with permission, write a one-page summary, write a value report, and draft your 90-day plan.

31
00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.910
Continue with the lessons below.
